{%- comment -%}
  LH400 - Lock dimensions
  Figma: "Lock dimensions" (desktop 1344x661 stage, mobile 402x1298).
  Line drawings of the front panel, mortise latch and back panel with their measurements.
  Every measurement and callout is a text setting; the note under the drawings is rich text.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'lh400-assets' %}
{{ 'lh400-dimensions.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<section class="lh lh-section lh-dimensions" style="--pt:{{ section.settings.padding_top }};--ptm:{{ section.settings.padding_top_mobile }}">
